return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:25:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:25:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Sayar da bakuncin Zinn Digital® daga shafin WordPress na kanku — WordPress, WooCommerce, hukuma, reseller, cloud da bakuncin VPS. Bincika kuma ku bayar da yankuna daga asusun reseller naku, shigar da abokan cinikinku kai tsaye cikin rukunin bakuncinsu, sannan ku samar da bakunci ta atomatik lokacin da aka biya odar WooCommerce.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Dandalin karɓar baƙuncin ya ba da amsa da matsayin %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Nemo sunan yankinku','Search'=>'Bincika','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsawo ba don wannan sunan.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Binciken sunan yanki ba ya aiki a wannan shafi a yanzu haka.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Ba mu sami damar isa ga wurin rajistar yankin ba a yanzu haka. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da wani ɗan lokaci.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Mabuɗin API ɗin ya ɓace ko kuma ba shi da aiki. Bincika shi a ƙarƙashin Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Wannan maɓallin API ba ya ɗauke da izinin sites.view, wanda binciken yankin (domain) ke buƙata. Ƙara shi zuwa maɓallin a cikin rukunin dillalin ku, ko share maɓallin a nan don komawa zuwa bincike na jama\'a.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Masu gudanarwa ne kaɗai ke ganin wannan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Ba mu iya duba wannan ba — sake gwadawa','Already registered'=>'An riga an yi rajista','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Akwai shi — tambaye mu farashi','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Akwai shi — %1$s %2$s na shekarar farko','Register it'=>'Yi rajistar shi','Manage my hosting'=>'Sarrafa bakuncin gizo na','Please sign in first.'=>'Da fatan za a fara shiga.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Wannan asusun ba a haɗa shi da sabis ɗin ɗaukar nauyin yanar gizo ba tukuna.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Dandalin ba da masauki bai dawo da hanyar shiga ba.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Kayan Aikin Mai Sake Sayarwa','Account'=>'Asusu','Features'=>'Fasali','Styling'=>'Tsara Salon','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakilan AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ba da izinin wakilan AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Kashe: kayan aikin da ke ƙasa da hanyoyinsu na REST ba a yi musu rajista ba ko kaɗan.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Asusunka na dillalin Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ƙirƙiri maɓallin API na mai sake sayarwa a cikin dashboard ɗinka na Zinn® a ƙarƙashin Developer → API keys, sannan liƙa shi a nan.','Reseller API key'=>'Makullin API na Dillali','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Ana ajiye shi a wannan rukunin yanar gizo kawai, kuma ba a taɓa haɗa shi a cikin fitarwa ko rahoton gano matsala ba.','Plan to provision'=>'Tsarin da za a samar','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Lambar tsarin da ake sanya sabbin kwastomomi a kai. Bar shi a fanko don a riƙa tambaya a kowane lokaci.','API address'=>'Adireshin API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Kyale wannan sai dai idan tallafin Zinn® ya nemi ka canza shi.','Control-panel address'=>'Adireshin faifan sarrafawa','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Inda mahadar "Bakuncina" ke tura abokan cinikinka.','Domain search'=>'Binciken yanki','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Shigar da gajeren lambar [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Sanya gajeren lambar (shortcode) a kowane shafi domin ba wa baƙi damar duba yankin yanki (domain) da kuma saya ta hanyar ku.','Panel link'=>'Mahadar faifai','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Nuna hanyar haɗi ta "Bakuncina" ga abokan cinikin da suka shiga','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Samar da WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Samar da bakuncin kai tsaye lokacin da odar WooCommerce ta kammala','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Yana aiki ne kawai akan oda da ke ɗauke da samfurin da kuka haɗa da tsarin Zinn®.','Domain search appearance'=>'Kamanin binciken yanki','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Wannan widget yana nunawa a cikin jigon kanku. Zaɓi saiti da aka rigaya aka yi, ko saita launukanku — ta kowace hanya ba a ƙara komai a shafukanku wanda mai ziyara zai iya gani a matsayin namu ba.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Kowace aji da widget ɗin ke amfani da ita an jera ta a cikin readme na plugin ɗin, domin mai haɓakawa ya iya sauya duk abin da saitin da aka riga aka yi bai rufe ba.','Follow my theme'=>'Bi jigon nawa','Soft'=>'Mai laushi','High contrast'=>'Babban bambanci','Compact'=>'Takaitacce','Buy-link colour'=>'Launin mahadar saye','“Available” colour'=>'Launin "Akwai"','“Could not check” colour'=>'Kalar "Ba a iya dubawa ba"','Error colour'=>'Kalar kuskure','Corner rounding'=>'Kusurwoyin zagaye','Space inside each row'=>'Wuri a cikin kowane layi','Text size'=>'Girmar rubutu','Domain-name weight'=>'Nauyin sunan yankin','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Babu maɓallin API na dillali tukuna.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Binciken yanki ya riga ya yi aiki ba tare da shi ba, a farashin jama\'a. Mahadar kwamiti da samar da WooCommerce suna buƙatar mabuɗi: ƙirƙiri ɗaya a cikin dashboard ɗinka na Zinn® a ƙarƙashin Developer → API keys.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Bude allon sarrafawa na na Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'An saita maɓalli, amma ba a kunna komai ba.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Babu ɗaya daga cikin fasalolin nan guda uku da aka kunna, don haka wannan manhaja ba ta yin komai a rukunin yanar gizonku. Kunna abin da kuke buƙata a ƙarƙashin Fasaloli.','Open Features'=>'Bude Fasaloli','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'A shirye — an kunna fasali %d.' . "\0" . 'A shirye — an kunna fasaloli guda %d.','Selling from'=>'Sayarwa daga','Settings'=>'Saituna','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Babu maɓallin API tukuna, don haka babu abin da aka haɗa.','Not connected: %s'=>'Ba a haɗa ba: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'An haɗa. Shirin dillalin ku shine %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ba a saita maɓallin API na Zinn® ba, don haka ba a samar da komai ba.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Wannan oda ba ta haɗa da sunan yanki ba, don haka babu abin da za a tanada.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Dandalin karɓar baƙuncin bai dawo da shafi ba.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'An samar da bakuncin Zinn® don %1$s (sabis %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Dandalin karɓar baƙuncin bai dawo da asusun abokin ciniki ba.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Ba a samar da bakuncin Zinn® ba: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Layin samfur na Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Layin samfur na Zinn® da za a samar yayin da aka sayi wannan samfurin. Bar shi a sarari don amfani da wanda aka saba amfani da shi daga saitunan manhajar plugin.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Bakuncin Zinn®','Service id'=>'ID na sabis','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Ba a samar da komai ba don wannan odar.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Rubuta sabon kima don maye gurbinsa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jeri…','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan lissafi','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Taƙaitaccen bayani','Copied'=>'An kwafa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane manhajar Zinn® a wannan shafi, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar wata haɗi don wannan manhajar.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ku da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake saita zuwa na asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai mayar da kowane saiti na wannan plugin ɗin zuwa na asali. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken gano matsala don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamu ko maɓallan API — za ku buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan manhaja an mayar da shi zuwa na asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin babu shi.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga manhajar ƙari ta Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ya yi girma da yawa don zama fitarwar saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwar saitunan Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani daban na toshewa (%s), don haka shigar da shi a nan zai adana saitunan da wannan toshewar ba ta fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saiti %d. Ba a taɓa saka kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.','Connected'=>'An Haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma akwai abin da ke buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana gudana a kan asusunka na kanka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya duba wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan manhajar ba ta faɗi dalili ba. Aika rahoton binciken matsala kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Duba na ƙarshe %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana budewa a sabon shafi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi ne ainihin abin da za a aika — babu wani abu kuma babu abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinku, alamomin shaida da maɓallan API ɗinku ba sa ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kofa zuwa allon kofa','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan rahoton zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe tikitin tallafi a gare ku kuma mu ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ba kwa son aikawa, kwafi shi a sama sannan ku liƙa da kanku a cikin tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan sabar ba (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti a maimakon haka — babu wani abu da ba daidai ba game da saitunanku.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonka kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonka — lamba %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika rahotanni da yawa a cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna sannan ku sake gwadawa — na farkon sun iso.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ba ta iya karɓar rahoton ba a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu take, ba daga naku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama kuma buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani da %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, adana bayanan yau da kullum, sauya wurin aiki kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da shafukan da aka kafa, yankuna (domains) da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi (link placements), tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu zaman kansu ta duniya: bincika ayyuka da aka shirya sama da 10,000 daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya aiki kuma bari su yi tayin farashi.','Style preset'=>'Saitin salon da aka riga aka saita','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wurin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa yana maye gurbinsa.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girman nawa','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma za a yi amfani da tsarin da aka riga aka saita daidai yadda yake.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawa ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya isa ga dandamalin Zinn®, sannan sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar ba daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s). Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta gaza a binciken amincinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Ba a iya kammala aikin ba. Sake gwadawa, kuma idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, tuntuɓi mai kula da shafin.','Connect an AI app'=>'Haɗa aikace-aikacen AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Wannan buƙatar haɗin ta ƙare. Koma zuwa manhajar kuma sake fara haɗawa.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s na neman izinin amfani da %2$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizon a matsayin %3$s. Zai iya yin abubuwan da aka ba asusunka na WordPress izinin yi kawai, kuma za ka iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga saitunan wakilan AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya bayyana kansa daga %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya yi wa kansa rajista ta atomatik. Ci gaba kawai idan ka fara wannan daga %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Asusunka ba zai iya amfani da waɗannan kayan aikin a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Bayan ka amsa za ka koma zuwa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Bada izinin %s','Do not allow'=>'Kada a yarda','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Wani ƙima da ake buƙata ya ɓace ko kuma yana da tsari mara kyau. Duba tsarin shigarwa (input schema) na damar.','The site refused the request.'=>'Shafin ya ƙi amincewa da buƙatar.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Bada damar mataimakan AI kamar Claude, Cursor ko VS Code su yi aiki a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga a matsayin mai amfani da WordPress (Claude da ChatGPT ta hanyar amincewa da su a nan, wasu kuma da kalmar sirri ta manhaja) kuma suna iya yin abin da aka ba wannan mai amfani damar yi kawai.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakilan AI na buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko na gaba. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adireshin haɗi (matsayar MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude da ChatGPT: shiga maimakon haka','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ƙara adireshin haɗin azaman mai haɗawa na musamman a cikin Claude, ko azaman manhaja a yanayin mai haɓakawa na ChatGPT. Suna buɗe wannan shafin don ku iya amincewa da su; babu kalmar sirri da za a kwafa.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Manhajojin AI da aka haɗa da asusunka:','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗi','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Sauran manhajojin AI: kalmar sirri ta manhaja','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta manhaja domin mai amfani da kai','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ƙara wannan a cikin saitunan MCP na manhajar AI ɗinka, tare da sunan mai amfani da kuma waccan kalmar sirri:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: saka shigarwar iri ɗaya a ƙarƙashin "servers" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin "mcpServers" ba.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Kayan aikin da wakilin AI zai iya amfani da su a nan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Jagorar mai amfani: Wakilan AI da MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Takaddun masu haɓakawa: iyawa, REST da MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Sarrafa abokan cinikin karɓar baƙuncinku, tsare-tsarensu da rukunin yanar gizon su a kan Zinn Digital® daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Abokan cinikinka, tsare-tsarensu da shafukansu, ta hanyar asusun dillalin Zinn Digital® naka.','Read your reseller account'=>'Karanta asusun dillalin ku','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Yana mayar da asusun dillalin ku a karantawa ɗaya: alama, tsare-tsare, adadin abokan ciniki da ayyuka, da abin da aka saita.','List your clients'=>'Jera abokan cinikinka','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Yana lissafa asusun abokan cinikinka, shafi ɗaya a lokaci guda (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Ƙirƙiri abokin ciniki','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar asusun abokin ciniki a ƙarƙashin naka (name; default_currency, lambar haruffa uku). Saka su a cikin tsari kafin rukunin yanar gizon su na farko.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Karanta tsarin abokin ciniki','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Yana mayar da tsarin da abokin ciniki yake kai da kuma kuɗin da yake ci maka (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Sanya abokin ciniki a kan wani tsari','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Yana sanya abokin ciniki a ɗaya daga cikin tsare-tsarenku (client_id, plan_code; interval: month ko year). Yi wannan kafin rukunin yanar gizonsu na farko.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Lissafa tsare-tsaren da za ku iya sayarwa','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Yana jera tsare-tsaren karɓar baƙuncin yanar gizo da farashinsu (product_line da currency suna taƙaita shi).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Jera shafukan abokan hulɗarku','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Yana lissafa duk abin da ka samar wa abokan cinikinka (client_id da kuma status suna takaita shi), shafi ɗaya a lokaci guda.','Create a site for a client'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafi don abokin ciniki','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar rukunin yanar gizo da aka karɓi baƙuncinsa don ɗaya daga cikin abokan cinikinka (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Ana lissafin kuɗinsa zuwa asusunka a kan tsarin abokin ciniki, kamar daga shagonka.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Dakatar da shafin abokin ciniki','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Yana sanya shafin abokin ciniki a dakatarwa saboda rashin biyan kuɗi (site_id; reason: bayanin kanku, wanda ba za a taɓa nunawa abokin ciniki ba). Shafin zai daina aiki har sai an cire dakatarwar.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Ɗage dakatarwar shafin abokin ciniki','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Yana ɗage dakatarwar rashin biyan kuɗi, domin rukunin yanar gizon ya sake aiki (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Karanta saitunan Reseller Toolkit','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Yana mayar da saitunan wannan manhaja (adireshin API, tsarin da sabbin oda ke amfani da shi, fasalolin da ke kunne). Ba a taɓa mayar da maɓallin API ba, sai dai kawai idan an ajiye ɗaya.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Sauya saitunan Reseller Toolkit','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Yana canza saitunan da kuka aika (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) kuma yana adana sauran. Ana canza maɓallin API da adireshin a allon kawai.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Da farko ka ƙara maɓallin API na dillali na Zinn Digital® a allon Reseller Toolkit.']];